       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CHAR-INTRINSICS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-A PIC 9(3) VALUE 7.
       01 WS-B PIC 9(3) VALUE 12.
       01 WS-R PIC 9(3).
       01 WS-T PIC X(5) VALUE "abc".
       01 WS-U PIC X(5).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           COMPUTE WS-R = FUNCTION MAX(WS-A WS-B).
